## mobile-sam.yaml (mobile SAM launchers)
actor-gurz =
    .name = Gürz Mace
    .description =
    Mobile air defence: ripples of four fast missiles
    that corkscrew onto aircraft, and a 35 mm cannon
    for anything that comes close.
      Strong vs Aircraft and Helicopters
      Cannot attack ground targets

actor-meads =
    .name = Aegis Lance
    .description =
    Long-range mobile air defence: hit-to-kill missiles
    launched straight up, fired in any direction without
    turning. Also shoots down rockets, cruise and
    ballistic missiles.
      Strong vs Aircraft and Missiles
      Cannot attack ground targets

actor-spyd =
    .name = Spyder Talon
    .description =
    Mobile air defence: a turning launcher with Python
    heat-seeking and Derby radar missiles that climb
    high and dive onto aircraft.
      Strong vs Aircraft and Helicopters
      Cannot attack ground targets
